# The classic Arx arm fixed (#466.1): `arms classic` draws the Arx arm itself with one clean
# bend at the elbow and a rigid forearm. status.json (PROPOSED names, 466.1 implements them):
#   vr.body.<hand>.classic.creases           bands between consecutive vertex rings along the arm whose bend angle
#                                            exceeds classic.creaseThreshold (PROPOSED, 20 degrees): the elbow is 1
#   vr.body.<hand>.classic.forearmTwistSpread degrees of roll spread along the forearm's rings: rigid is < 2
# Poses: hanging, ahead (nearly straight), the elbow bent ~90 and ~135 (tight, pulled in to the chest), the hand
# rolled 90 / 180.
# Needs the first-person save:
#   .\scripts\dev\xrs-run.ps1 arms-classic
#   .\scripts\dev\smoke-test.ps1 -VrSim idle -Sequence arms-classic -Save mvp-new-game
@sim idle
@save mvp-new-game
@args --loadslot 0

@until state eq GAMEPLAY 60s
@until vr.sim.timelineFrame ge 270 60s       # 3 s into the level: past its fade-in (TRAPS.md)
@assert player.controlsBlocked eq false
@assert vr.body.bound eq true
@assert vr.body.active eq true

vr-sim head rot 0 -65 0
vr-sim hand left off

arms classic
@frames 10
@assert vr.body.armsModel eq classic

# 1. Hanging by the side: the arm is straight, the forearm vertical; one bend at most
vr-sim hand right pos 0.2 -0.55 -0.1
vr-sim hand right rot 0 0 0
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.posed eq true
@assert vr.body.right.error lt 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.creases eq 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.forearmTwistSpread lt 2
@shot classic-hanging

# 2. Ahead, reached out
vr-sim hand right pos 0.2 -0.3 -0.55
vr-sim hand right rot 0 90 0
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.error lt 1
# the arm is straight here (measured elbowBend 9.7, the rest bend straightened out): no crease, never a second one
@assert vr.body.right.classic.creases le 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.forearmTwistSpread lt 2
@shot classic-ahead

# 3. The elbow bent about 90 degrees (hand ahead at chest height)
vr-sim hand right pos 0.12 -0.2 -0.35
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.error lt 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.creases eq 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.forearmTwistSpread lt 2
@shot classic-bend090

# 4. The elbow bent about 135 degrees (pulled in to the chest)
vr-sim hand right pos 0.06 -0.12 -0.1
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.classic.creases eq 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.forearmTwistSpread lt 2
@shot classic-bend135

# 5. The hand rolled a quarter and a half turn, ahead: the forearm stays rigid, the roll goes to the wrist or elbow band
vr-sim hand right pos 0.12 -0.2 -0.35
vr-sim hand right rot 90 0 90
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.error lt 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.creases eq 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.forearmTwistSpread lt 2
@shot classic-roll090
vr-sim hand right rot 180 -90 0
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.error lt 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.creases eq 1
@assert vr.body.right.classic.forearmTwistSpread lt 2
@shot classic-roll180

@assert errors eq 0
